        <mxCell id="note-0" value="Authored evidence can enter at candidate creation&#10;Developers can write design notes, requirements, code, and review rationale directly. LLM extraction is optional. Existing controlled evidence supplies context without passing through transcript ingestion. Both paths need clear ownership, version references, and the applicable reviews." style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;align=left;fontSize=15;fontColor=#52616b;fontFamily=Arial;" vertex="1" parent="1">
